WEBVTT

NOTE Captions match the narration. Times follow the spoken words.

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.420
Add a plan when acceptance needs evidence.

2
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.900
Ordinary chat does not require the CLI.

3
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:12.830
Write a short spec, one
acceptance criterion and a task.

4
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.570
Review the executable
and literal arguments.

5
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.650
Saving the command does not run it.

6
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.030
Verification runs a real local process.

7
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:29.510
A nonzero exit remains failed.

8
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.791
We now create ready.txt in
the synthetic source folder.

9
00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:37.030
The previous failed
receipt stays unchanged.

10
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:39.830
Choose a new attempt deliberately.

11
00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:43.630
The new receipt records
the successful exit.

12
00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.090
Recheck reads the same receipt.

13
00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:50.490
It cannot launch that verification again.

14
00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:54.840
An existing SpecWeave
ledger stays authoritative.

15
00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:58.980
Its done entry remains
external, unverified evidence.

16
00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:02.460
Routines keep their
project and host scope.

17
00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.740
This demonstration routine is disabled.

18
00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:09.460
Pause the project to refuse new work.

19
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:13.180
It does not kill an already running turn.

20
00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:18.530
New routine runs remain blocked
while the project is paused.

21
00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:24.310
Deletion requires the exact project name.

22
00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:27.790
This is a disposable synthetic project.

23
00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:33.100
Deleting project history leaves
its source folder intact.
